  ### Quick 1-Line Python Decryptor for CTFs

  Whenever you encounter substitution ciphers, you can run a one-line Python script to test your key:

    python3 -c '
    text = open("substution2.txt").read()
    src = "nafvptrxeszqgwyhlbkZNVLYGHBWFK"
    dst = "theflagispcomuryndbCTFNRMYDUBF"
    print(text.translate(str.maketrans(src, dst)))
    '

